# This is a simple Rack middleware that generates a flamegraph for the request
# if the X-Vernier-Interval header is set. The header value is the sampling
# interval in microseconds. If no header value is set, the default interval is
# 1000µs.
# This is an alternative to the middleware includede in the vernier gem, which
# is limited to GET requests and depends on query parameters. Using a header
# is more flexible and allows to generate flamegraphs for any request, including
